<p>You tessellate your cloak with small pieces of metal, providing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">22, 30, 36, 41, 46</acronym> damage reduction against all attacks.</p><p>The myriad metal scraps also help against incoming projectiles, providing a <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">32%, 35%, 38%, 40%, 41%</acronym> chance of deflecting them to a nearby spot.</p>